      "writtenOn": "2023-04-14T22:15:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I find these parameter names to be confusing.\n\nHow about:\n```\nmax_write_length: Maximum number of bytes written to the UART during a single write\npayload_length: Total length of the payload\npayload: Payload bytes to write\n```\n\nYou could also use `chunk_length` in place of `max_write_length`",
